  "description": ".NET for Mac Catalyst / .NET MAUI bindings for the native Datadog iOS SDK's DatadogSessionReplay framework: records and replays user sessions, with privacy levels that mask text and user input. Session Replay is iOS/iPadOS-only upstream and records nothing on Mac Catalyst - this package ships so shared code that references it compiles and links unchanged. Built against dd-sdk-ios 3.15.0. Requires RUM to be enabled.",
